# Adapted from C4-PlantUML, samples/C4_Context Diagram Sample - bigbankplc.puml (MIT)
direction down
title "System context: Internet Banking System"

pill customer [user]: Personal Banking Customer | a customer of the bank
banking: Internet Banking System | view accounts, make payments
engine mail [mail]: E-mail system | Microsoft Exchange
engine mainframe: Mainframe Banking System | core banking information

customer -> banking : uses
mail -> customer : sends e-mails to
banking -> mail : sends e-mails, SMTP
banking -> mainframe : uses
